<title>USA: Wake County, N.C., repriced, yields cut.</title>
<headline>Wake County, N.C., repriced, yields cut.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>First Union Capital Markets Corp. said Wednesday it repriced Wake County, N.C., $22 million bond deal, lowering yields in several maturities.</p>
<p>COUNTY OF WAKE, NC</p>
<p>RE: $22,205,000*</p>
<p>SPECIAL OBLIGATION BONDS</p>
<p>(SOLID WASTE MANAGEMENT PROJECTS), SERIES 1997</p>
<p>VERBAL AWARD.</p>
<p>PLEASE NOTE THE REPRICING</p>
<p>   MOODY'S: Aa2		   S&amp;P: AA</p>
<p>   DATED: 08/01/1997	    FIRST COUPON: 02/01/1998</p>
<p>DUE: 02/01</p>
<p> MATURITY		AMOUNT*    COUPON	   PRICE</p>
<p>02/01/1999		2,800M    4.00  %	  4.00</p>
<p>02/01/2000		2,910M    4.00  %	  4.05</p>
<p>						  (Approx. $ Price 99.882)</p>
<p>02/01/2001		3,030M    4.10  %	  4.10</p>
<p>02/01/2002		3,155M    4.20  %	  4.20</p>
<p>02/01/2003		3,290M    4.20  %	  4.25</p>
<p>						  (Approx. $ Price 99.756)</p>
<p>02/01/2004		3,435M    4.30  %	  4.35</p>
<p>						  (Approx. $ Price 99.719)</p>
<p>02/01/2005		3,435M    5.00  %	  4.40</p>
<p>						  (Approx. $ Price 103.781)</p>
<p>CALL FEATURES: NON-CALLABLE</p>
<p>* - APPROXIMATE SUBJECT TO CHANGE</p>
<p>The compliance addendum MSRB Rule G-11 will apply.</p>
<p>The award is expected Thursday, July 31, 1997.</p>
<p>Delivery is expected on August 13, 1997.</p>
<p>This issue is book entry through DTC.</p>
<p>First Union Capital Markets Corp.</p>
<p>J.C. Bradford &amp; Co.- Charlotte</p>
<p>Craigie Incorporated</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
